  you prepare for the Canadian Citizenship Test:\n•	Learn about the test
 ’s content and structure\n•	Get support and tips from CultureLink’s 
 Volunteer Mentors\n•	Practice with sample quizzes\nOctober 19-November 2
 3: Room 1\nNovember 30-December 21: Room 2/3
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, See program description.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac40aaa035faf0033da8d3d
X-SOURCE:Volunteer Toronto
END:VEVENT
